notes[2]{created_at,author,text}:
  "2026-08-06T17:05:55.428Z",codex-root,"Credentials, raw live payloads, entity IDs, user IDs, context IDs, and location details remain only in 0600 global configuration or transient process memory and never enter Git or PM evidence."
  "2026-08-07T05:15:27.695Z",codex-root,"No Home Assistant credentials, endpoint, entity identifiers, user identifiers, or raw live payloads were added to Git, GitHub, or PM evidence. No release was published."
learnings[2]{created_at,author,text}:
  "2026-08-06T17:05:55.428Z",codex-root,"Home Assistant 2026.8.0 keeps test_condition, subscribe_condition, and execute_script stable; the local 2026.7.4 instance supports the same contracts, enabling current-plus-backward compatibility proof."
  "2026-08-07T05:15:27.695Z",codex-root,A workflow_dispatch rerun on the exact SHA is useful evidence but does not populate pull-request branch-protection contexts; retrigger the pull_request event when an Actions incident loses the original webhook.
