close_reason: Typed automation runtime feature shipped to protected master without publication
body: "The CLI already discovers, validates, and subscribes to automation triggers. Stable Home Assistant Core also exposes test_condition, subscribe_condition, and execute_script. This feature completes the agent workflow from discovery and validation through runtime evaluation and guarded execution while retaining raw ws passthrough for future integration-specific contracts."
